# #5837, condition 4 (a5e2e2ef): an orphan sibling's forward under the transfer and
# forward class. It edits an operator, not an action.
MODULE: SnapshotHonestForwardAttributedToForwarderToken
TARGET: SnapshotHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an orphan's forward is attributed to its forwarder's own token, so the forwarder, which never applies it, advances and captures past it
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithOrphanForward = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
FwdToken == "empty"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the forwarding activation's own token.
FwdToken == "a2"
--- END
